From: Armbian
Subject: drm: backport Synopsys USB-C DP hotplug and audio

Backport the AUX, HPD and audio changes from the Synopsys DP v12 series.
Accept HPD from the USB-C connector's DisplayPort reference.
Replay HPD events that arrive before DRM registers the connector.
Enable DP audio when the controller declares the audio DAI argument.

